  proposers plus the minted version), all five run, all defined in D66 and
  imported here unmodified: REG (the layer's own tuple order), REGA (all
  registers sorted by name), ARBLOSE (losers, winners, version), ARBVFIRST
  (version first), COV (the register-free surrogate, the only one also defined
  on sprinklings).

